{
  "_comment": [
    "SAMPLE ONLY — this file is NOT live. Nothing here is active until you MERGE",
    "the `hooks` block below into .claude/settings.json (or settings.local.json).",
    "",
    "MERGE, do not replace: .claude/settings.json already carries a `Notification`",
    "hook. Copy the event keys you want from below and leave the existing ones.",
    "",
    "Enable them in the order given. `ripple-stamp-before-push` is deliberately",
    "LAST and is commented out — it is the one hook with a moderate-to-high",
    "false-positive profile. See README.md.",
    "",
    "PATHS: $CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR is expanded by Claude Code before the command runs.",
    "python3 is used throughout; on a Windows shell without a `python3` shim,",
    "replace it with `python` (both were verified present on this machine).",
    "",
    "DISABLE any single hook by deleting its entry. Disable ALL of them by",
    "removing the keys you added. There is no other state — the hooks write",
    "nothing except .git/srmech_ripple_stamp.json, which is inside .git and is",
    "never staged."
  ],

  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/docs/srmech/python/tools/hooks/git_add_all_blocker.py\"",
            "timeout": 10
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/docs/srmech/python/tools/hooks/stale_native_tripwire.py\"",
            "timeout": 20
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/docs/srmech/python/tools/hooks/ssot_agreement.py\"",
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write|NotebookEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/docs/srmech/python/tools/hooks/generated_file_edit_blocker.py\"",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],

    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/docs/srmech/python/tools/hooks/ssot_agreement.py\"",
            "timeout": 20
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/docs/srmech/python/tools/hooks/stale_native_tripwire.py\"",
            "timeout": 20
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/docs/srmech/python/tools/hooks/derived_ledger_freshness.py\"",
            "timeout": 30
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/docs/srmech/python/tools/hooks/ratchet_recount.py\"",
            "timeout": 240
          }
        ]
      }
    ],

    "SubagentStop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/docs/srmech/python/tools/hooks/ssot_agreement.py\"",
            "timeout": 20
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/docs/srmech/python/tools/hooks/derived_ledger_freshness.py\"",
            "timeout": 30
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/docs/srmech/python/tools/hooks/ratchet_recount.py\"",
            "timeout": 240
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },

  "_ship_last_when_you_are_ready": {
    "_why": [
      "ripple-stamp-before-push blocks `git push` on an op-touching branch unless",
      "tools/hooks/ripple_stamp.py recorded a green ~27-minute sweep at the current",
      "HEAD. It collides with the standing quota discipline ('commit and push",
      "incrementally'), which is why the [ripple-pending] escape token exists.",
      "To enable: move this entry into hooks.PreToolUse under the Bash matcher."
    ],
    "matcher": "Bash",
    "hooks": [
      {
        "type": "command",
        "command": "python3 \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/docs/srmech/python/tools/hooks/ripple_stamp_before_push.py\"",
        "timeout": 20
      }
    ]
  }
}
